cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Hibiscus in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Hibiscus: a self-hosted training platform for LeRobot policies"
abstract: >-
  Hibiscus is a self-hosted, team-oriented web platform to upload LeRobot datasets, train
  LeRobot policies (ACT, Diffusion, VQ-BeT, TD-MPC, SmolVLA, pi0) on local GPUs with live
  monitoring, and export verified model bundles (LeRobot pretrained_model, ONNX, offline
  evaluation) that run directly on real robots.
authors:
  - alias: Bigkatoan
  - name: "The Hibiscus contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Bigkatoan/Hibiscus"
url: "https://bigkatoan.github.io/Hibiscus/"
license: AGPL-3.0-only
version: "0.1.1"
keywords:
  - robotics
  - imitation learning
  - lerobot
  - machine learning operations
  - training platform
  - onnx
references:
  - type: software
    title: "LeRobot: State-of-the-art Machine Learning for Real-World Robotics in Pytorch"
    authors:
      - name: "Hugging Face"
    repository-code: "https://github.com/huggingface/lerobot"
    license: Apache-2.0
